@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:如果不是除掉，<br>那就是把她们当作垫脚石了吧。|#0205Trial04_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:超凡脱俗的外貌……压倒性的吸引力和演技……<br>你凭这些魅惑了所有观众——|#0205Trial04_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:对于那些想要与你并肩的人，<br>你是不是只把她们当作<br>让自己更显眼的台阶而已？|#0205Trial04_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:而目的就是成为最显眼的明星。|#0205Trial04_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,Arms,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Pale>Pale01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:…………呵、哈哈哈……|#0205Trial04_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆照れ

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR8,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:别、别这么夸我。|#0205Trial04_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.24
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:（居然害羞了……）|#0205Trial04_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR8,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，是啊……<br>我承认自己确实背景条件优越。|#0205Trial04_Leia011| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,Arms,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:但是，为了不让人觉得我是纯粹靠背景，<br>我一直都付出了最大的努力。|#0205Trial04_Leia012| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR5,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:如果有人想与我并肩而立——|#0205Trial04_Leia013| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR9,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:我并不会将其当作垫脚石，<br>而是视作互相竞争、共同进步的同志。<br>一直都是这样。|#0205Trial04_Leia014| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Damage

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:"（唔……<br>　我说的话没法撬开她的内心吗？）|#0205Trial04_Hiro014|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

